  "title": "A full hotel with infinite rooms can still take guests",
  "body": "Hilbert's hotel has rooms 1, 2, 3, ... all occupied. One more guest arrives: move everyone from room n to n+1 and room 1 frees up. Even infinitely many new guests fit by moving n to 2n. Infinity plus one is not bigger; that is almost its definition.",
